  "description": {
   "en": "A story about the relationship between Tainaka Seri, a mid-career manga artist who has only had one successful work, and her new editor Futami Sumire. When her editor, who has been with her for 10 years since her debut, decides to transfer, Seri is introduced to her new editor Sumire. Sumire says she is a fan of Seri's, and while Seri is surprised by her unique way of closing the distance, she is somehow fascinated by her...\n\n(Source: Natalie, translated)",
   "ja": "は、1作だけ売れたことのある中堅マンガ家の田井中せりと、新しい担当編集者・双海すみれの関係を描く物語。デビューから10年一緒にやってきた担当編集の異動が決まり、せりは新担当のすみれを紹介される。せりのファンだというすみれだったが、彼女の独特な距離の詰め方に、せりは驚きつつもなぜか魅了されていき……。"
  },
